&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why&amp;nbsp;Lookfantastic?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lookfantastic&amp;nbsp;is one of the world&#39;s leading online beauty destinations, bringing together an exceptional portfolio of global beauty brands with a truly international customer base.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Buying Director,&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;have the opportunity to shape the proposition of a globally recognised beauty business, influence some of the industry&#39;s biggest brands and lead a team at the heart of our commercial growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who wants real ownership, significant&amp;nbsp;scale&amp;nbsp;and the opportunity to make a visible impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If&amp;nbsp;you&#39;re&amp;nbsp;a commercially ambitious buying leader with a passion for beauty and&amp;nbsp;a track record&amp;nbsp;of delivering growth,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
