&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FREE NOW is an equal opportunity employer and we consider qualified applicants regardless of race, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We want you to grow and evolve, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOUL_n8pSGQ&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bring your true self to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Freenow, the European taxi app with the broadest multi-mobility offering, available in 9 markets and over 180 cities. Our app gives millions of passengers the freedom to move with a wide choice of services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds and public transport. Headquartered in Hamburg and led by our CEO Thomas Zimmermann, we are on a mission to make urban mobility more efficient, sustainable and inclusive. Since July 2025 we have been part of Lyft, a global mobility platform connecting riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together we are building a more caring and connected world, creating new opportunities for innovation, growth and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to step into a senior leadership position at the heart of Verifone’s global payments ecosystem. You will shape operational risk management across four regulated payment entities, influence the future of our payments &amp;amp; financial services strategy, and drive automation and continuous improvement at scale. For an experienced operational risk leader, this role offers the chance to modernise first‑line operations, strengthen controls, and contribute directly to how a renowned, established company continues to grow its presence in the UK/EU market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Whilst our preferred office location for you to be close to is Munich, we are open to considering candidates located near to our Bad Hersfeld, Helsinki, and Bucharest office too.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all first line activities across the four Verifone payment entities, covering the teams responsible for onboarding, re-underwriting, fraud and AML transaction monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first contact point for all 1st line questions and escalations across the four entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a consistent first line operating model, standards and performance expectations while respecting entity-specific regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own first line KPIs, SLAs and quality metrics, ensuring case volumes and backlogs are managed within risk appetite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and remediate gaps across the onboarding, re-underwriting, fraud and AML transaction monitoring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the first line control environment and ensure controls are effective, evidenced and audit-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve higher-risk onboarding cases and escalation decisions, including complex ownership and foreign-owned structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary focus is on: Merchant onboarding, KYC, CDD and KYB, Periodic, trigger-based and event-driven re-underwriting and risk reviews, Fraud monitoring and case management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AML transaction monitoring, sanctions and transaction screening, and alert handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and deliver the automation roadmap to reduce manual effort, improve accuracy and scale operations across entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of automated onboarding/KYC, risk scoring, alert triage and transaction monitoring tuning to reduce false positives and shorten cycle times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the onboarding process offers the best possible client experience while applying regulatory requirements proportionately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop a people strategy that allows execution upon the vision – across functions and locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product teams to ship and deliver best-in-market KYC product experiences to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilise data and user research to optimise the onboarding experience and transform how we fight financial crime and fulfil regulatory obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise third-party services and outsourced vendors (1st line related) across the operating model&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide management information and reporting to the EMEA CFO, senior leadership and risk committees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with second line (Compliance/Risk), internal audit, partner banks and technology to close findings and embed sustainable fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop and scale multi-team, potentially multi-jurisdiction operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in payments/fintech operations, risk or financial crime, with substantial time in first line leadership roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on knowledge of merchant onboarding/KYC, CDD, KYB, re-underwriting, fraud monitoring and AML transaction monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of corporate structures, UBO analysis and foreign ownership models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of identifying and mitigating gaps across these processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience automating onboarding, monitoring and case management processes with measurable efficiency gains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with regulated (payment) services &amp;amp; acquiring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with KYC/AML systems, TM tools, sanctions/watchlist databases and adverse media platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the applicable EU regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in client contact and managing client relationship processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and meet deadlines without sacrificing quality of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and collaboratively, depending on the situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively present information to regulators and/or Verifone Group Senior Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership experience, managing managers and large operational teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Most engineers build. Some engineers shape what gets built.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Formlabs, we’re building the tools that make it possible for anyone to bring their ideas to life. Our 3D printing technology powers innovation at more than 50,000 industry leaders worldwide, including Apple, Tesla, and NASA. But to change how the world creates, we need more than just R&amp;amp;D; we need people who can bridge the gap between engineering and business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re studying STEM and wondering how your skills translate into the real world beyond the lab, there’s a path you might not have explored yet: &lt;strong&gt;Technical Sales&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our next phase of growth, we’re building an exceptional, tech-savvy Direct Sales Team in Berlin to solve real-world problems for our customers. If you’re ready to shape the future of fabrication, come build it with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4ayzNOZbn5E&quot;&gt;Watch this video&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our powerful 3D printing ecosystem from our Chief Revenue Officer, Nick Graham:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/4ayzNOZbn5E&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xxzyx7NzGK0&quot;&gt;Watch this video&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Sydney Fenner&#39;s experience on the Technical Sales Team:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/xxzyx7NzGK0&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consult &amp;amp; Solve&lt;/strong&gt;: Understand customer demand to effectively sell cutting-edge additive manufacturing technology using a solution-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify leads and follow up on inbound inquiries via phone and email.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Train &amp;amp; Educate&lt;/strong&gt;: Become a knowledgeable champion of Formlabs technology through hands-on training with our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;: Coordinate regular touch points with industry leaders to align our technology with their sales growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent&lt;/strong&gt;: Be the face of Formlabs at trade shows and onsite customer events, where our products are on the cutting-edge of additive manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Graduating with a bachelor’s or master’s in a STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability: Are eager to secure your offer now for a full-time start date in October 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: Speak C1+ English plus one of the following: German, Spanish, Italian, French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindset: Naturally curious, results-oriented, and able to handle rejection with a focus on learning and adapting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Relationship-builder who thrives in a team environment but is capable of working independently to drive results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robust equity program to build future wealth through RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Catered on-site lunches (3x per week), snacks, beverages, &amp;amp; treats&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Many opt-in culture events across our diverse community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly 59.85 EUR mobility subsidy (incl. BVG Firmenticket &amp;amp; Swapfiets)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplementary, opt-in German pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefits including weekly yoga classes, Urban Sports Club discount, and free mental health &amp;amp; well-being sessions with an external partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And of course…&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;unlimited 3D prints&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are all owners of Formlabs and direct beneficiaries of our success. We believe that equity is a critical component of compensation at Formlabs, and we want our newest team members to understand the potential value of their equity compensation. Full time employees receive equity, in the form of RSUs. Your financial investment will grow with us in accordance to your impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role also has an On-Target Earnings (listed below) which includes a base salary and an uncapped performance-based monthly bonus. The base/bonus split will depend on what level you are hired into, and your level will be determined by your skills, qualifications, experience and expected impact on the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual pay range for this role is:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;€60.000&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;€72.000 EUR&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Even if you don&#39;t check every box, but see yourself contributing, please apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Help us build an inclusive community that will change the face of 3D printing. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your personal data is processed in accordance with our Privacy Policy. If you have any questions or wish to exercise your rights under applicable privacy and data protection laws, please contact us at&amp;nbsp; &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Group is the world&#39;s leading integrated food solutions provider, with a global portfolio of brands spanning meal kits, ready-to-eat meals, and specialty products. From our Berlin headquarters, we build and run the technology that delivers millions of meals every week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome team players who thrive in a dynamic environment, lead with ownership, and bring diverse perspectives to the table. If you are motivated to grow in a culture that champions speed and agility, data-driven decision making, and customer centricity, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Foundations Alliance builds the tools and infrastructure that empower engineering teams across HelloFresh. Cloud Runtime sits at the center of it: we provide a reliable and highly performant multi-cluster container platform so that every HelloFresh engineer can deploy services with 99.99% uptime, high performance, low latency, and minimal operational overhead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Manager for Cloud Runtime, you will lead a squad of platform engineers who own the container platform, networking, and traffic routing that more than 1,000 production services depend on across Europe, North America, and Australia and New Zealand. You will partner closely with our Product Manager to turn a defined platform strategy into a roadmap the team can execute, and you will be accountable for the reliability and cost of what we run.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role. Your day will not be spent writing code, but you will be close enough to the system to read a pull request, follow a debugging session, and challenge the team on any technical decision they bring you, from an architecture proposal to an incident postmortem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, grow, and support a distributed squad of platform engineers, with team members based in Berlin and Poland, owning hiring, development, and performance for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain an engineering roadmap spanning one to two quarters, and make explicit trade-offs between features, timelines, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive our core platform commitments: expanding into a highly available platform with failover between pre-provisioned clusters, increasing adoption of our container platform and multi-region deployments, and reducing infrastructure cost through networking and compute optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the squad&#39;s operational metrics and be accountable for moving them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and role-model postmortems, and drive the follow-through on action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with key infrastructure vendors and work with Security on audit and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Observability, Release Engineering, and Security squads, where our roadmaps are tightly coupled and dependencies run in both directions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster an inclusive and open working environment, and create the kind of documentation and knowledge sharing that makes the team less dependent on any single person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a team of engineers, including hiring, performance management, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a team that is split across more than one location, and the habits that make that work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical background in cloud infrastructure, with hands-on experience of Kubernetes and at least one major cloud platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the surrounding ecosystem: service mesh, API gateways, infrastructure as code, GitOps-style deployment, and secrets management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to contribute technically when needed, whether that means reviewing code, pairing on a problem, or helping debug an incident&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning production systems with meaningful availability targets, including incident response and on-call practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Judgement about when a decision is reversible and when it is not, and a willingness to front-load design effort on the ones that are not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, and the ability to say no to a loud request that is not on the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication and strong asynchronous collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh Group better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences, so even if you don&#39;t tick all the boxes but think you&#39;d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About RELEX:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;RELEX Solutions create cutting-edge supply chain and retail planning software. Within our platforms, we have the power and potential to increase adaptability, efficiency, and sustainability in the consumer goods and retail value chain. Our impact is tangible; from sustainability and eliminating waste to delighting customers and delivering great tailored tech solutions, we’re curious and passionate challenge-seekers creating the future of retail today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re currently a global team of 2000+ employees working from offices in the US (Atlanta), UK, Germany, Sweden, Norway, Denmark, France, Italy, Spain, Portugal, Singapore, Australia, and our headquarters in Helsinki, Finland. We work in small teams where everyone’s input is valued. We’re passionate about what we do, we like putting our skills to the test, and we make sure we have fun during the process — because life is supposed to be fun.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RELEX Solutions is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced (Senior) Marketing Manager to take ownership of various field marketing projects across Europe and with a specific focus on the DACH region. In this role, you will be responsible for executing strategic marketing initiatives that drive demand generation, strengthen partnerships, and accelerate sales opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with the Field Marketing, Sales, Business Development, and Customer Success teams to develop and implement localized marketing strategies that align with our key industry verticals and buyer personas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to shape and execute key components of our EMEA go-to-market strategy, including trade shows, customer activations, executive events, and digital campaigns. If you are a strategic thinker with hands-on marketing expertise, a deep understanding of B2B enterprise sales cycles, and experience engaging senior decision-makers in retail, wholesale, and manufacturing industries, this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Event &amp;amp; Field Marketing Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute integrated event marketing programs that align with business objectives, including in-person trade shows, conferences, association activations, executive briefings, and virtual experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the event calendar and execution of regional events, including contract negotiations, vendor management, site selection, registration, agenda planning, staffing, on-site production, signage, and content development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage custom events that engage both customers and prospects, driving lead generation and strategic account engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketing and promotional strategies around RELEX Live events across EMEA, ensuring alignment with pipeline goals and industry engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop co-marketing initiatives with partners, media, and associations with joint value propositions incl. events, webinars, campaigns, and content syndication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and evaluate industry events to determine sponsorship and engagement opportunities aligned with RELEX’s target verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Marketing &amp;amp; Campaign Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop promotional and engagement strategies to ensure event participation from the right audience at the right time, driving SQLs and qualified meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our solution experts, ABM, Global Campaigns, and Brand &amp;amp; Creative teams to develop high-impact content and assets (landing pages, videos, handouts, digital ads, social banners, etc.) tailored to our target sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute pre-, during-, and post-event campaigns that maximize attendance, brand awareness, and pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and measure event impact on pipeline, marketing-influenced revenue, and sales acceleration to refine future strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct pre- and post-event analysis to evaluate success metrics, optimize lead qualification processes, and ensure strong alignment with sales follow-up strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide data-driven insights to inform marketing decisions and improve ROI on event investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in B2B field and event marketing, preferably in technology, supply chain software, or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing both in-person and digital events as part of an integrated marketing strategy that supports pipeline acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with sales and business development teams to align marketing initiatives with revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the B2B sales funnel, pipeline management, and the role field marketing plays in lead conversion and acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management and prioritization skills, with the ability to manage multiple programs and stakeholders simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with experience developing marketing content for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A results-driven, self-motivated mindset with a passion for creating measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sense of ownership, accountability, and a desire to contribute to RELEX’s growth in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably experience within the Manufacturing industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are a global community of different cultures, voices, and experiences. We celebrate what makes us unique and connect through what we share, in an authentic and safe environment. Together we shape the future, and each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;If you feel this is the opportunity you don’t want to miss, you can apply by sending your cover letter and resume through the application form as soon as possible. If you have questions, Noemi ----- from our Talent Acquisition team is happy to answer them by email. Please note that we cannot process any applications through email.   &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Apply today and be part of the future. Be RELEX!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director of Product Design for the Frontend Technologies Domain, you will establish the foundation that enables high-quality experiences across all aspects of Vinted user experience. Your mandate is to increase the quality of the global UI for tens of millions of members. You will share accountability over domain’s success with your Engineering &amp;amp; Data Science counterparts, building foundational technical capabilities to balance developer velocity with an exceptional end-user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase frontend delivery efficiency &amp;amp; quality (AI-powered software development)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase internal tool quality and delivery efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that our services comply with accessibility regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase impactfulness and quality of Vinted UI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high performing and engaged team, make timely, high-quality decisions concerning priority setting and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional level of craft leadership, holding a consistently high bar for end-to-end quality and autonomously setting the product&#39;s visual strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading design infrastructure, design systems, and frontend technologies at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading organizational change, comfortably adapting team structures and processes to meet evolving business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing multiple teams or a domain, including coaching managers and senior individual contributors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an excellent communicator, capable of articulating complex design and technical trade-offs to cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points for technical fluency and experience driving AI-enablement in frontend development and design process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€147.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Mews&#39;s Front of House engineering organisation is growing in scope and clarity of purpose, and this role directs a significant part of it. The problem is real and specific: how do you scale a guest experience platform to recognise and personalise across millions of interactions, while keeping delivery fast, systems healthy, and teams capable of moving with confidence? Mews serves thousands of properties globally, and the data and distribution advantages that come with that scale are genuinely uncommon — this is a chance to shape the engineering organisation that makes that advantage meaningful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll direct the engineering teams building guest recognition, personalised experiences, automation, role-aware workflows, and joined-up guest journeys — a cross-product area that touches every part of how guests and hotel staff experience Mews. You&#39;ll work closely with Product, Design, Data, and other engineering directors to translate a clear long-term strategy into execution, at a moment when Front of House has made quality, delivery rigour, and proactive operational health a deliberate priority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The problem is worth naming plainly. Scaling personalisation across millions of guest interactions — while keeping engineering teams sharp and systems healthy — requires someone who can set direction, develop managers, and hold a high bar without being the person writing the code. This is a role for someone who has built engineering organisations through scale and ambiguity before, and who can make the structural and cultural changes that let a complex engineering organisation move sustainably fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Direct the engineering teams across guest recognition, personalised experiences, automation, and role-aware workflows, building clarity, accountability, and a high-performance culture through managers and senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Set engineering direction that balances speed, quality, and long-term scalability across a complex, cross-product area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work across Product, Design, Data, and other engineering directors to turn strategy into execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Raise the bar on engineering excellence, operational health, and delivery rigour — areas Front of House has made a clear priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive effective cross-team work where ecosystem value flows across Front of House, Back of House, Platform, and Fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Coach engineering managers to make sound judgements, reduce unnecessary complexity, and build teams that move fast without collapsing under scale or operational pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate strategy into measurable outcomes, with clearer metrics, stronger prioritisation, and tighter links between engineering delivery and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt; In this role, that means you have changed how a whole engineering organisation works through AI — not just your own workflow or your immediate team&#39;s. You have helped set the standards, tooling, and expectations for how engineering teams use AI responsibly and effectively at scale. You know when AI output is good enough to act on, when it needs scrutiny, and you&#39;ve built that judgement into how your teams operate — not just modelled it yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/external/YWI5ZGUyMGQ3MjU2NGRmNjlkZGEyYTg2NTVmZGE0OTU&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Significant experience directing engineering organisations in a modern B2B SaaS, platform, or product company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A track record of building through scale, ambiguity, and change — developing healthy organisations through managers and senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong technical judgement: the ability to guide architecture, quality, and execution at the right level of involvement without needing to be across every technical choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;The ability to work closely with Product and Design in a model where business context, user value, and engineering execution are tightly integrated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A bias for clarity, pragmatism, and high standards — with the willingness to make hard trade-offs and keep teams focused on what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience in a hospitality, travel, or guest-facing product domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CRM-adjacent systems, guest data platforms, or personalisation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 901 500 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 961 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£103,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£155,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€111.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€164.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 030 500 kr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 525 000 kr SEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$178,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$272,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€116.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€172.400 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior Product Designer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; - Join Our Innovative Team at think-cell Software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At think-cell, we create powerful software solutions that help professionals be more efficient and productive. Founded in 2002 and based in Berlin, our tools integrate seamlessly with Microsoft Office to help users create presentations, charts, and diagrams with ease. Our dynamic, international team values creativity, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt; own the end-to-end experience of our AI product, from first concept to polished, shipped interactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt; work as a core member of a product team, collaborating closely with a Product Manager and engineers from discovery onward,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;together&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;turning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt; real customer problems into intuitive, delightful designs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;. For a highly visual, data-rich product like ours, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;great design&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;isn&#39;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt; a finishing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;touch,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt;it&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot;&gt; what makes features land. This is a pivotal, hands-on role with real ownership and influence over where the product goes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW26242374 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end user experience of our products, from early concepts and flows to shipped interactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design end-to-end user journeys and craft intuitive, delightful interfaces for a data-rich, highly visual product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead discovery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;16&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work alongside Product Managers and Engineers to discover customer insights and turn problem statements into prototypes, flows and validated solution designs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;16&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Run user research, customer interviews, and usability tests and iterate quickly to keep the experience grounded in evidence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
